## 3. 5min parquet not registered in `source_tables` / 5分钟 parquet 未注册 (3 signals)

| Signal | Missing table |
|---|---|
| `HfReturnKurt` | MinuteParquet — 5min frequency |
| `HfReturnSkew` | MinuteParquet — 5min frequency |
| `PATV` | MinuteParquet — 5min frequency |

**Fix location / 修复位置:** `core/data_sources.json`

**根因：** `source_tables` 中只有 `1min` 频率的 parquet 配置（第 22-42 行），信号需要 `5min`。需增加 `5min` 条目，指向对应的路径模板和 `sample_date`。

The existing `source_tables` entries only cover `1min` frequency (line 22-42). Add parallel entries for `5min` pointing to the correct path template and `sample_date`.

