## 5. Single-date pipeline produces all-NaN / 单日期管线全 NaN (3 signals)

| Signal | Cause |
|---|---|
| `DazzlingVol` | `ts_sum(..., axis=0)` on single date |
| `RS` | `delay(axis=0)` on single date |
| `Return_night` | `ts_sum` window=20 on single date |

**Fix / 修复方法:** Use multi-date chunks (e.g., `chunk_size > 1`, `overlap >= window`). Verify before treating as a real bug.

**说明：** 当前测试只跑了单日期，`delay`/`ts_sum` 需要历史数据才能产生有效值。用 `chunk_size > 1`、`overlap >= window` 重新运行即可。确认后才是真正的 bug。

